INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80158481, 'A vain, self-righteous nobleman falls in love with a village girl and tries to transform her into his version of the ideal woman.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80177684, 'Simple songs mix with colorful animation to teach youngsters about concepts such as animals, vehicles, numbers, colors and more.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70299811, 'A woman from a small mountain village disobeys her village elders and sets out for the big city in search of her missing husband.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80116687, 'An aspiring hair stylist opens her own salon. It turns into a mail-holding hub for busy neighbors, but she seizes the chance to promote her business.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80157457, 'After a car accident enables a young woman to hear mysterious sounds, she meets a mortician. Together, they listen to ghosts and try to help them.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70229498, 'Learning of a fortune in gold being secretly shipped to Romania, master thieves Charlie and Riya assemble a crack team to steal it.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (20257393, 'A college grad in need of money must disguise himself as an old man to tutor two young women who are under the watchful eye of their strict aunt.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80159899, 'A spoiled young woman steps in to save her family’s restaurant with her cooking and tasting skills while balancing her complicated love life.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70155574, 'Homespun humor and easygoing Sheriff Andy Taylor are at the center of this nostalgic look at Mayberry, a small town filled with lovable characters.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80093106, 'After waking next to his now-dead lover in a hotel room, a young businessman hires a prominent lawyer to figure out how he ended up a murder suspect.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80157567, 'Two doctors with opposite approaches to treating patients clash on the job and must learn to trust each other''s expertise, allowing love to bloom.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80157390, 'A veteran cop forms an agency dedicated to solving cold cases, including those related to the team members'' own painful and mysterious pasts.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70172488, 'Hosted by creator Rod Serling, this groundbreaking anthology series presents tales of the supernatural that are often tinged with social commentary.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80157392, 'Love and intrigue swirl around two women – one a champion of human rights, the other an ambitious businesswoman – who were switched at birth.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80171528, 'A police officer and a psychologist learn of a sinister threat at a highly anticipated soccer match and team up in hopes of preventing disaster.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70153408, '"Who killed Laura Palmer?" is the question on everyone''s lips in a secretive small town, but as an eccentric FBI agent learns, the answer isn''t easy.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80157645, 'When a hard-nosed detective reluctantly partners with an informant to solve complex cases, she uncovers links to a particularly puzzling cold case.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80187467, 'When Pakistani authorities learn of a looming terrorist strike, they ask a retired intelligence officer to counter the attack before it''s too late.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80160125, 'A group of struggling individuals are united by a love of soccer. At the center is Renxin, a reclusive widower and former coach who needs new hope.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80187323, 'Two identical strangers pursue their respective dreams after exchanging lives and getting out from under the thumb of their controlling loved ones.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80157132, 'When his brother becomes involved in a deadly bank robbery, a heartbroken cop vows to track down and retrieve his wayward sibling – dead or alive.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80157864, 'When a frustrated businessman starts his own firm, it soon morphs into a way to help senior citizens refresh their dying traditional trades.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80157717, 'Two lonely singles meet on a blind date and slowly get to know each other, unaware that their parents are friends and may be falling in love.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80093104, 'At Christmas, Zip and Zap take a trip with their parents to a remote island, where a friendly woman runs a children''s home and mystery awaits.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70153390, 'This intense police procedural follows a group of extraordinary FBI profilers who spend their days getting into the minds of psychopathic criminals.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80127764, 'This documentary follows 10 men who agree to walk the Camino de Santiago, a 500-mile, 40-day trek that will challenge their strength and faith.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80095411, 'Therapist Jean Holloway develops dangerous and intimate relationships with the people in her patients'' lives in this simmering psychological thriller.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80156387, 'Akko enrolls at the Luna Nova Witchcraft Academy. She''s not the best student, but her bright attitude is the key to her and her friends'' success.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80190144, 'This film chronicles the journey of Fannie Haughton, an Oakland activist who fled to Grenada with her family just prior to the U.S. invasion in 1983.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80091936, 'A gentle giant and the girl who raised her are caught in the crossfire between animal activism, corporate greed and scientific ethics.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80133553, 'Unbridled comic Chris D''Elia reconsiders his approach to major life events like marriage, not having kids and buying pants for your friends.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80161640, 'Gay activist Michael Glatze begins a painful journey when he decides to renounce his sexuality for his religion in this drama based on true story.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80108952, 'When a Chilean policeman vows to find and capture leftist poet Pablo Neruda, a game of cat and mouse ensues that tests both their wills.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80171598, 'The happy life of a young blind couple is shattered when the wife is raped and corrupt police won''t help, sending the husband on a quest for revenge.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80191356, 'To keep pal Boots from being sent to a rival school with better athletics, prankster Bruno leads an epic campaign to build a pool at Macdonald Hall.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80191357, 'The biggest troublemakers at Macdonald Hall are Bruno and Boots, who are caught and face an unthinkable punishment: separation into different dorms.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80143794, 'This documentary profiles William Powell, who wrote the "The Anarchist Cookbook" in the early 1970s and spent his later life regretting his actions.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80168227, 'Hulk Hogan''s court case against Gawker Media sheds light on wealthy, powerful figures who challenge freedom of the press in order to silence critics.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70026432, 'How did the King of the Jungle ascend to the throne? Find out in this charming prequel to the hit animated movie that catches Tarzan as a young child.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80155477, 'After a one-night stand, Holly develops a dangerous obsession with Tyler and transfers to his high school, desperate to keep their "romance" alive.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80167644, 'After learning they are the sole survivors of an eerie apocalypse, a young American couple on vacation in Iceland ponder their love and the future.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80027041, 'This four-part anthology of short horror films features stories that include some traditional themes but all are shown from a female point of view.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80166185, 'A once-promising wrestler pursues the gold medal he never won by training two of his daughters to compete at the Commonwealth Games.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80031377, 'A female food blogger is hired as a personal chef by a young tech tycoon and faces a new menu of challenges, both inside and outside of the kitchen.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80173234, 'The brotherly bond between three childhood friends – one Sikh, one Muslim and one Catholic – is tested by the often comic absurdities of adulthood.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80000139, 'Teenage Pac and his loyal crew face the ups and downs of adolescence while protecting Pac-World from a ghostly army led by the evil Betrayus.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80151644, 'After tumbling into a magic storybook, Puss in Boots must fight, dance and romance his way through wild adventures as he searches for an escape.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80185223, 'Comedian Rory Scovel storms the stage in Atlanta, where he shares unfocused thoughts about things that mystify him, relationships and the "Thong Song."');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80160814, 'Two criminals race down a stairwell, a cop close behind. A bickering family begins a road trip. Their journeys will take far longer than expected.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80038159, 'Conducting a study on the psychology of incarceration, a Stanford professor assigns guard and prisoner roles to 24 male test subjects in a mock jail.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80026224, 'Amid the turmoil of 1960s LA, two cops and a prominent political family are drawn into the sex- and drug-fueled web of a young Charles Manson.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80049873, 'As boxing''s popularity wanes, three fighters at different stages of their career make sacrifices to pursue their dreams of becoming champions.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80094358, 'A look at the life of karate master Fumio Demura shows how he spread the discipline in the West, winning countless devotees and influencing Hollywood.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80174177, 'This film examines the link between diet and disease, and the billions of dollars at stake in the healthcare, pharmaceutical and food industries.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80007778, 'The reality show "WOW!" engages the Winx in their mission, starting an undercover, worldly journey in order to make talented kids'' dreams come true.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80164206, 'Torn between old camaraderie and recent tensions, three ex-soldiers reunite to explore a deadly cave but soon discover terror beyond all expectations.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80187684, 'Despite doubts from fellow villagers who think he’s crazy, an ambitious dropout commits himself to solving a persistent local electricity crisis.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80160726, 'Eclectic character comedian Marco Luque plays himself in this stand-up special about relationships, regional differences and his own love of movies.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80104706, 'World-renowned choreographer Ohad Naharin is profiled in this vivid documentary that mixes rehearsal footage with insights about his influence.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80172284, 'This film examines the complex life of iconic filmmaker Stanley Kubrick, as seen through the eyes of his devoted longtime driver, Emilio D''Alessandro.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80158770, 'Starting in 1881, this film describes how the personal battle between the royal Romanovs and Lenin''s Ulyanov family led to the Russian Revolution.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80176756, 'When the king of Brittania dies, the dragon who shares his heart must find a new ruler, but the monarch''s grandchildren go to war over the throne.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80168221, 'Two delusional geriatrics reveal curious pasts, share a love of tuna and welcome a surprise guest in this filming of the popular Broadway comedy show.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80163409, 'When her fiancé acts strangely upon receiving a mysterious invitation, a florist sets out to find out the truth behind the tiny scrap of paper.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (60001104, 'An African American Gullah family leaves their coastal island home in 1902 and risks losing their culture to start a new life on the U.S. mainland.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80132601, 'An alcoholic with a tragic past rents an apartment in a building for those in recovery, but soon learns the truth about residents who get "evicted."');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80163277, 'When an ordinary guy crosses paths 15 years later with his childhood sweetheart, now an actress, a magic cellphone allows him to be her protector.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80176866, 'Disguised as a bodyguard, a special agent must complete his national secret tasks while pandering to the whims of his ill-tempered world star.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80162114, 'A top detective in the violent crimes unit becomes the sole guardian of his 6-month-old niece when his sister and her husband pass away unexpectedly.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80163369, 'In a luxurious condominium complex with draconian rules forbidding all romance, two residents fall in love and dare to start a secret relationship.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80114989, 'Haunted by the past, a master swordsman masks his identity to work anonymously as a janitor in a brothel, setting in motion a violent chain of events.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80163266, 'A college art club welcomes a new member who has the secret ability to smell death and who warns one of them to leave her boyfriend ... or else.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80178564, 'When things don''t go her way during a shooting for her new show, a top actress runs away in an old van that guides her on a time-traveling journey.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80103734, 'Unfolding in reverse time, this darkly comic crime thriller follows a local sheriff hunting three bank robbery suspects, one of whom is his brother.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80159025, 'A young actress rehearsing for a play about human trafficking begins to relive terrifying scenes that may be dreams – or an alternate reality.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80042309, 'Waiting for news of her prisoner-of-war husband, a French woman in Nazi-occupied France reluctantly falls for a German officer quartering in her home.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80169554, 'Five children living on the edge of a forest band together to save a magical wishing tree from destruction and find their own paths to happiness.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80144311, 'Three lifelong friends travel to Acapulco ostensibly so one of them can find his lost love, but the real reason behind the trip holds some surprises.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80109145, 'When a young man wakes from a coma, memories of brutal violence begin to surface, putting his life – and that of his doctor – in jeopardy.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80117455, 'A master criminal engineers his own shooting during a police raid, then refuses treatment while awaiting rescue in a tense standoff at a hospital.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80132626, 'A poorly constructed tunnel collapses, leaving a man trapped in his car with only two bottles of water and his daughter''s birthday cake to survive on.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80121844, 'While Spain relinquishes its last colonies, a battle-fatigued outpost engages in a long, brutal and sometimes bizarre clash with Filipino insurgents.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80133117, 'In exchange for low rent, a hodgepodge group of 20-something tenants set up residence as property guards in a disused hospital, where hilarity ensues.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80046249, 'In his funky California beach enclave, Chip''s the go-to guy for personal insights. But he isn''t quite as enlightened when it comes to his own baggage.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80158750, 'After searching for his abducted son for three years, a devastated father attempts to track down his missing child through lucid dreams.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80176840, 'Panelists from the Korean show "Abnormal Summit" lead cast mates on tours of their home countries, including China, Nepal, Italy, Canada and France.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80157084, 'Raised by a kindly thief, orphaned Jimmy goes on the run from goons and falls in love with Jyoti, whose father indirectly caused his parents'' deaths.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80158580, 'Eight decades after her disappearance, Amelia Earhart''s incredible accomplishments are still celebrated, thanks in large part to her sister Muriel.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80108609, 'This documentary dives into the complex world of Herbalife, the international nutritional products company accused of being a pyramid scheme.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80173267, 'This revealing documentary probes the onstage personas of Portland, Oregon, burlesque performers who practice wildly different art forms.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80144804, 'Two college frenemies whose lives aren''t what they hoped meet up decades later and escalate their resentments from verbal jabs to bloody brawls.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80139214, 'On point and larger than life, rapper and stand-up comic Chingo Bling gathers his funniest friends for a rambunctious take on Tex-Mex culture.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80106038, 'On a small Finnish island in 1666, a teenage girl in love with a married fisherman becomes the center of a tragic witch hunt and power struggle.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80122189, 'Possessed lovers, witches, haunted houses and more bring tales of horror to the screen in this anthology series.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (60000901, 'The Grinch decides to rob Whoville of Christmas – but a dash of kindness from little Cindy Lou Who and her family may be enough to melt his heart.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80158769, 'Explore how Caesar, Napoleon, Mussolini, Hitler and modern-day dictators consolidated their considerable power through bold and brazen coups.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80158579, 'Rachael Stirling narrates this multifaceted portrait of former First Lady Jacqueline Kennedy Onassis and her younger sister, Lee Radziwill.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80121872, 'In British-ruled, 19th-century India, a 14-year-old girl trains as a warrior and becomes a devoted crusader in her country''s fight for independence.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80158920, 'Addicted to webcams and voyeurism, a married man gets more than he bargained for when an online stranger tries to force him to watch a suicide.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80107736, 'After moving from New York City to a small town in Washington state, an interracial couple and their preteen son struggle to adjust to their new life.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80148967, 'When a fashion blogger falls for a video game vlogger, their romance goes viral. But separating their virtual life from reality gets complicated.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70057994, 'A beautiful, wealthy woman’s insatiable appetite for romance leads to tragedy and a police investigation.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80186862, 'Benjie Nycum travels to Wyoming to visit his ex-lover, Michael Glatze, a former gay activist who now lives with his wife and works as a church pastor.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80157207, 'With the help of a cop, a psychologist and a woman who can foretell the future, a brilliant paralegal works to solve an array of perplexing mysteries.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80176449, 'Four animal superheroes called the Miniforce transform into robots to protect small and defenseless creatures from the hands of scheming villains.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80131505, 'After a natural disaster known as the Big Fart leaves Earth divided, only Sheriff and his rebel misfits can protect the planet from a mutant invasion.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80102549, 'Photographer, writer and director Sam Jones sets his famous guests at ease with his freewheeling, insightful celebrity interviews without agendas.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80156937, 'A penniless actor new to Mumbai and a beautiful woman he meets one fateful night try to stop a gangster from replacing India''s president with a twin.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80035684, 'From his days as a petty thief to becoming head of a drug-trafficking empire, this riveting series charts the life of the infamous Pablo Escobar.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80175277, 'Jino and his Watch Car, Bluewill, compete in the Battle League to become world champions. Meanwhile, a dark force threatens to destroy them all.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80158546, 'To better himself, a spoiled prince temporarily assumes a commoner’s identity. But he soon learns his palace has been gifted to his father’s new wife.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80122239, 'From teen lovers defying social and religious taboos to a student falling for her teacher, these stories explore joy and heartache in modern romance.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80156936, 'When an abusive landowner is murdered, his twin brother sets out to find the killer but quickly discovers that everyone, it seems, wanted him dead.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80121871, 'A complex love triangle goes horribly wrong in this epic, multigenerational saga involving romance, revenge, mistaken identity and amnesia.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80121843, 'Betrayed by the Spanish government he once served, a former secret agent plots to steal millions of dollars embezzled by a corrupt public official.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80124091, 'In 1967, two brothers from Copenhagen, Denmark, wind up in an orphanage, where the headmaster''s cruel tyranny slowly provokes the kids to push back.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80157244, 'A mysterious, wealthy man offers three people a lucrative, unusual job that may be too good to be true: Live the high life as his children and heirs.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80122238, 'Writer, poet and lyricist Javed Akhtar hosts this musical trip down memory lane, revealing untold stories behind India''s best songs of 1950-75.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80158581, 'Jessica and Diana were sisters who were separated by just a few years in age. But their political ideologies couldn''t have been any farther apart.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (60023237, 'When rich teens Tenoch and Julio meet the alluring, older Luisa, they try to impress her with stories of a road trip, then convince her to join them.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80176144, 'A filmmaker trains the camera on her own family as she examines the impact her grandfather, troubled artist Arshile Gorky, had on three generations.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80024103, 'This anthology series unfolds a different story arc for each season, with dramas focusing on aspects of American life and the criminal justice system.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80133554, 'In her first comedy special post-health scare, Sarah Silverman shares a mix of fun facts, sad truths and yeah-she-just-went-there moments.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80148223, 'The furor over the addition of two Muslim players to the Beitar Jerusalem soccer club underscores the role of institutionalized racism in Israel.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80176342, 'During World War II, daredevil star Miss Julia entertains soldiers at the Indo-Burma border, where she''s caught up in a web of love and deceit.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80010655, 'When the black sheep son of a respected family threatens to expose dark secrets from their past, sibling loyalties are put to the test.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80167459, 'This intense documentary follows real cases of American girls enslaved in the child sex trade through ads in a newspaper''s online classified section.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80169348, 'Mobilized by teenage activist Joshua Wong, young citizens of Hong Kong take to the streets in a bid to preserve their history of autonomy from China.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80164778, 'After street smart kid Raees rises to become Gujarat''s bootlegging king in the 1980s, he tries to balance his life of crime with helping his people.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80000063, 'This parody of first-person shooter games, military life and science-fiction films centers on a civil war fought in the middle of a desolate canyon.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80068327, 'When a proud general is tasked with winning an unpopular war, he takes the challenge head-on, not knowing that hubris may be his own worst enemy.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80117765, 'Convinced his stepfather caused the crash that left his mother in a coma, a law student drunkenly agrees to his murder, then can''t rescind the deal.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80165083, 'A futuristic France tries to keep its people from despair and rebellion over crippling poverty by engaging them with a violent TV competition show.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80134781, 'Comic Hasan Minhaj of "The Daily Show" shares personal stories about racism, immigrant parents, prom night horrors and more in this stand-up special.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80098046, 'A pregnant teen is forced by her family to leave her boyfriend and assume a new identity in America, but 12 years later, the couple reunites in Korea.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80091779, 'After enduring both business and family upheavals, a ruthless investment director has a heart transplant and finds a new way to look at life and love.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80091783, 'On the cusp of marriage or divorce, four couples consider the meaning of love, sharing a life, meddling families and the weight of their commitment.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80131167, 'A blend of the royal family''s intimate recollections and rarely seen home movies pays tribute to Queen Elizabeth II on the eve of her 90th birthday.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80098047, 'When his big stock plan fails, a hotshot fund manager winds up homeless and must learn the secret ranking system of the street in order to survive.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80091781, 'A married middle-aged woman is swept off her feet, both romantically and artistically, by a gifted young pianist.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80091778, 'A renowned actor who is still pining over the loss of his first real love writes an autobiography about his memories of her, hoping to reconnect.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80018046, 'In 1950s Spain, the heir to a fashion house romances a beautiful seamstress who works for the company, despite the objections of his family.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80121973, 'An Ankara homicide detective with a dark personal life and a disdain for rules and political correctness solves murders and fights police corruption.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80115466, 'Inside a vast, self-replicating city bent on eliminating all life, mysterious loner Killy emerges to guide a remnant of humanity desperate to survive.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80176819, 'Pop stars and impersonators face off to be the last one standing as the audience tries to determine the real singer by listening to their voices only.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80173481, 'Thailand''s complicated history with marijuana continues to play a role in its policies and laws, as well as the health and security of its citizens.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80142223, 'After living as a man for nearly 60 years, Laerte Coutinho, one of Brazil''s most brilliant cartoonists, introduces herself to the world as a woman.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80044908, 'Classic nursery rhymes and children''s songs get a fresh twist in this high-energy program that helps kids learn as they dance and sing along.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80122179, 'This docuseries examines the decades-old murder of Sister Catherine Cesnik and its suspected link to a priest accused of abuse.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80047200, 'Religion thwarted Lucas and Jade''s young love. They reunite decades later, but Jade''s heart is torn between the man she knew and his younger clone.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70143864, 'Dr. Hank Lawson unexpectedly gets a career upgrade as a freelance physician treating New York''s aristocratic upper crust in their posh Hamptons homes.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80097814, 'In a film based on true events, an awkward but ambitious TV reporter struggles to adapt when she''s ordered to focus on violent and salacious stories.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70241757, 'A violent confrontation between a motorcycle-riding bank robber and a rookie cop spirals into a tense generational feud.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80133551, 'In his first special since his serious car accident, Tracy Morgan cracks jokes about life in a coma, his second marriage and his family''s dark side.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80157133, 'A village schoolteacher and the ghost of a murdered man, who were both betrayed by those closest to them, join forces to help each other.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80122237, 'This documentary series explores the glamour of Bollywood through the stories of the men and women who have illuminated its screens.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80107656, 'Chronicling a 1980 Titan II missile accident, this sobering documentary weighs the balance of power and safety involving weapons of mass destruction.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80157083, 'A dreamer falls for a girl who is in love with someone else and tries to create a rift between her and the man she loves.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80098287, 'Best friends Sarah and Mindy share an unexpected moment while on a road trip. Years later, the two struggle to reconnect before a wedding.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80059342, 'A Viennese child who was kidnapped and held captive in a basement before escaping after eight years reveals her headline-making story of survival.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (24081514, 'Two boyhood pals – one righteous, the other a criminal – take very different paths to adulthood. Their love for the same woman may prove disastrous.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70202589, 'In this updated take on Sir Arthur Conan Doyle''s beloved mystery tales, the eccentric sleuth prowls the streets of modern London in search of clues.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80047031, 'Inspired by a true story, this TV drama shadows a young Colombian woman who goes to shocking lengths to escape a life of poverty.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80128688, 'Buckle up for a look inside a biannual school bus race in Florida, a harrowing event where carnage and collisions are most definitely encouraged.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80157564, 'Before the dawn of World War II, an ambitious actress pursues her dreams in Berlin. But her plans derail when she becomes Joseph Goebbels’ mistress.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80178078, 'After burgeoning criminal Gunz joins the increasingly violent TIC crew, the gang finds itself dealing with threats from all sides.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80097726, 'Witness some of the most riveting showdowns in the animal kingdom as cameras capture leopards, polar bears and other predators targeting their prey.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80120740, 'When insurance accidentally pays her millions, retired teacher Eva and her pal Maddie head to the Canary Islands for the adventure of their lives.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80174364, 'Julien''s been dethroned, but loyal friends and some very unlikely allies will propel the lovable lemur on a colorful journey to take back his kingdom.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80114666, 'Examine the rise, fall and rebirth of political operative Roger Stone, who''s been an influential member of Team Trump for decades.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80049714, 'Dev tries to jump-start his acting career and elevate his dating game with help from his eclectic group of friends in this award-winning series.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80157866, 'When a twisted killer tells the police he''ll only speak to a fictional 1980s TV detective, the washed-up actor who played him takes the gig.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80161029, 'When his new love is captured by an evil snake charmer, a young cobra and his scorpion best friend set out across the desert on a wild rescue mission.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70261058, 'An outspoken, imaginative girl from a conservative family pursues her dream man while fending off the prospect of an arranged marriage.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70204288, 'A cooly confident aging hit man returns from exile in Paris to his old city, Mumbai, to revisit his past and perform one last job.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80057278, 'After a vengeful college professor targets corruption in the government, he adopts the name "Gabbar" and becomes a hero to a weary public.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70293703, 'An Indian intelligence agent journeys to a war-torn coastal island to break a resolute rebel group and meets a passionate journalist.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80165853, 'After a dedicated cop accidentally kills a 12-year-old boy, he''s fired, harassed and forced to take menial work as he tries to keep his life together.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80161108, 'After finding a peculiar key, three smart and adventurous kids launch a quest to uncover the whereabouts of a coveted archaeological treasure.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80082660, 'A young man determined to renounce Catholicism by having his baptismal records excised is thwarted by church bureaucracy and his own inner conflicts.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80134780, 'In this new stand-up special, Norm Macdonald delivers sly, deadpan observations from an older – and perhaps even wiser – point of view.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80106754, 'Three former military operatives offer disturbing, firsthand accounts of the deadly impact that U.S. drone warfare has had on civilians overseas.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80108613, 'In this blend of documentary and dramatization, circumstances test notions of love held by a young stripper, a single-dad surfer and a teen musician.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80106793, 'Homicide detective Gene Handsome sets out to solve a woman''s murder while searching for clues about what''s missing from his personal life.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80057609, 'Music meets imagination in this inventive animated series about thinking outside the box and having fun.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80124727, 'Eclectic stand-up comic Manu NNa relays everyday tales about the struggles of being gay in Mexico and shares his love of telenovelas and mezcal.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80117263, 'Self-professed teenage "space nerds" at Space Camp chase their dreams of traveling to Mars, while experts reflect on NASA''s history and future.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80126879, 'A naïve young woman goes to Istanbul to meet the now-grown boy who jokingly promised to marry her in 11 years after she saved his life as a child.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80047032, 'Three brothers seek to avenge the tragic death of a loved one, but become emotionally entangled with the daughters of those they hold responsible.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80133663, 'Maria Bamford performs a rapid-fire, playful stand-up set for crowds at park benches, bowling alleys and LA theaters in this roving comedy special.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80117082, 'A troubled couple living near the North Pole begins a perilous journey south in an attempt to find peace and vanquish ghosts from the past.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80134149, 'Obsessed with an unsolved murder case, a crime novelist stuck in an unhappy marriage fantasizes about killing his wife, who soon turns up dead.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80115133, 'In Singapore, a homeless ex-convict hoping to reunite with his family forms a bond with a Chinese sex worker while serving as her bodyguard.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80176698, 'After losing his seventh job in a row, a TV producer and sci-fi buff travels back in time to 1980, where his employment prospects improve.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80165848, 'When a small-town wedding videographer falls in love, he decides he needs to make more money and turns to shooting sexy videos – with mixed results.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70275753, 'A gay man deals with his sexuality, a struggling actor has an epiphany, a boy becomes a dancer, and a man tries to fulfill his father''s dying wish.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70295762, 'Disowned by his father as a boy, Surya is taken in by a crime boss. When his brother Shiv is wrongly imprisoned, his father pleads for Surya''s help.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80165849, 'In this thought-provoking biopic, an idealistic judo trainer adopts a boy from the slums and grooms him into the world''s youngest marathon runner.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80158395, 'A vulnerable singer is forced to choose between the girl he loves and another who has developed an unhealthy obsession with him.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70275774, 'When pretty new neighbor Seema falls for their shy roommate Sid, jealous womanizers Omi and Jai plot to break up the new lovebirds.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80103430, 'This film documents the story of minister Waitstill Sharp and his wife, Martha, who risked everything to save thousands of refugees fleeing the Nazis.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80165850, 'After learning he was adopted from a Muslim couple, a Hindu man seeks his birth father but finds he must confront his bigotry to realize his quest.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80103372, 'Six talented but struggling improv comics see a sudden shift in their troupe''s dynamic after one of them lands a much-coveted gig on television.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80068117, 'An unexceptional man becomes a murder suspect when the son of a high-ranking police official who harassed his daughter goes missing.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (20764666, 'After his brother dies, wealthy Vikram reluctantly returns to India and forms a surprise bond with his orphaned nephew and the showgirl raising him.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70268209, 'Dylan Mohan Gray examines Africa''s AIDS crisis and activists'' battle with pharmaceutical companies to make life-saving HIV drugs more affordable.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80165851, 'Hapless brothers Gollu and Pappu stumble into a terrorist plot and end up being ordered to detonate a bomb, a task they are destined to bungle.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70129415, 'This anthology features seven independent anime shorts from renowned directors, delving into the futuristic universe of the video game franchise Halo.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80095094, 'This film chronicles the career of photographer Harry Benson, who earned global renown with his candid shots of the Beatles and other celebrities.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80156763, 'When French-African couple Paul and Sali discover the longed-for baby they are about to adopt is white, family chaos and confrontation ensue.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80156857, 'The sudden disappearance of a wealthy banker''s wife cracks open a dizzying world of secret fetishes, desperate acts and elaborate deceptions.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70268489, 'An ad agency CEO is put under investigation when his ambitious protégée – and lover – accuses him of sexual harassment, vying for his top position.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80159732, 'Find out everything there is to know about Japanese tradition, from food to culture to objects and arts, and the people who are continuing it today.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80158588, 'Explore how John F. Kennedy''s worldview was influenced by his younger years, when he endured poor health, family tragedy and a demanding father.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80178720, 'Faced with a rare form of throat cancer, teen figure skater Carley Allison finds strength in singing for an online audience in this biopic.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80106505, 'Lives are upended when a hiking trip leads a Wall Street hotshot to explore his true feelings for an old pal who’s disenchanted with his boyfriend.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80169548, 'This documentary recounts the feats of the Coxless Crew, a team of four women who rowed from San Francisco to Australia in support of two charities.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80015785, 'The daughter of a poor rice farmer overcomes the objections of her father and the demands of a male-dominated society to pursue a career in boxing.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80097361, 'Poet and civil rights activist Maya Angelou is celebrated using her own words set over rare photographs and video illustrating her remarkable life.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80176716, 'After investing in a shady deal that quickly falls apart, a morally flexible real estate agent involves his wife in a dangerous recovery plan.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80132961, 'Explore the unconventional career of Sunny Leone, who transitioned from adult film star to Bollywood actress and reality TV star.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80165857, 'In Delhi for the first time, a Mumbai girl loses her phone but gets a surprise chance at true love with a local boy who begrudgingly helps her.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70258366, 'Mumbai shopkeeper Kanji Bhai files a lawsuit against God when an earthquake destroys his store and his insurance policy won''t cover the damage.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80165732, 'The lives of a Mumbai man and woman who are both dealing with issues intersect through a TV dance show that she wants to win but he wants to sabotage.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80165854, 'Matters of the heart introduce chaos into the once-idyllic bachelor existence of three young men who share an apartment.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80083589, 'Three young bachelors find the reality of relationships to be far removed from the idea of true romance that they had once pursued.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80032081, 'A jilted bride decides to go on her European honeymoon anyway – by herself – and ends up embarking on a journey of self-discovery.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (17457962, 'When a poor taxi driver falls in love with a wealthy young woman, he must stand up to her family and contend with his own insecurities.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80182105, 'This documentary profiles the celebrated Hindi film director known as much for his embrace of leftist politics and social concerns as lyrical cinema.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80165855, 'When they''re blackmailed after a hit-and-run, a troubled rich girl and her wild friends stage a fake kidnapping with a plan to collect the ransom.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70273637, 'In this fact-based crime drama, a gang of con artists posing as government officials executes a heist in the form of a raid on a prominent jeweler.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70176968, 'When London-based doctor Manu reluctantly returns to India to find a bride, he meets the girl of his dreams – only to discover she loves another man.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80173605, 'When a withdrawn, long-missing teenager reappears in a chilly alpine town, his heartbroken family begins to wonder if he''s actually who he says he is.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (80165856, 'A crabby woman leaves home for a vacation and entrusts her niece''s fiancé to feed her fish and adhere to a strict set of rules. He has other ideas.');
INSERT INTO MOVIE_DESCRIPTIONS (show_id, description) VALUES (70308135, 'Up to his old tricks, con man Dharam poses as a millionaire to get his younger son married to the daughter of a wealthy businessman.');
